{
  "name": "Torah Batch Callback",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Torah Batch Callback\n\n**Endpoint:** POST /webhook/torah-translation-callback\n\n**Reçoit le résultat du poller générique (mode multi) une fois le batch terminé:**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"multi\": true,\n  \"batch_id\": \"...\",\n  \"correlation_id\": \"...\",\n  \"results\": [\n    { \"custom_id\": \"123\", \"ok\": true, \"text\": \"...\" },\n    { \"custom_id\": \"124\", \"ok\": false, \"error\": { \"code\": \"errored\" } }\n  ],\n  \"metadata\": {\n    \"job_id\": \"...\",\n    \"project_id\": \"torah\",\n    \"target_lang\": \"français\",\n    \"callback_channel_id\": \"...\",\n    \"commentary_map\": { \"123\": { \"segment_id\": 456 } }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Notes défensives:**\n- `metadata` et `results` peuvent arriver en JSON string (JSON.stringify côté soumetteur) → parse défensif.\n- `job_id` peut être null (Create Job fire-and-forget côté dispatcher) → on saute le PATCH job mais on notifie quand même Discord.\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Validate Input (parse défensif metadata/results)\n2. Split Results : 1 item n8n / résultat, mappe custom_id → segment_id via commentary_map\n3. Saved? (IF ok) → Save Translation (POST /api/translations/save, onError continue — un échec de save est compté, pas silencieux)\n4. Collect (merge succès + échecs) → Aggregate Results (compte ok/erreurs)\n5. Job ID Present? → Update Job (PATCH /api/v2/jobs/{job_id}), sinon skip\n6. Prepare Discord → Send Discord Notification\n7. Respond",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "torah-batch-cb-sticky",
      "name": "Documentation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-64, -160]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "torah-translation-callback",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "torah-batch-cb-0001",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [0, 304],
      "webhookId": "torah-translation-callback"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// ============================================\n// VALIDATE CALLBACK INPUT (batch multi)\n// ============================================\n\nconst input = $input.first().json;\nconst body = input.body || input;\n\n// --- defensive parse: metadata may arrive as a JSON string ---\nlet md = body.metadata;\nif (typeof md === 'string') {\n  try { md = JSON.parse(md); } catch (e) { md = {}; }\n}\nmd = md || {};\n\n// --- defensive parse: results may arrive as a JSON string ---\nlet results = body.results;\nif (typeof results === 'string') {\n  try { results = JSON.parse(results); } catch (e) { results = []; }\n}\nresults = Array.isArray(results) ? results : [];\n\nconst errors = [];\nif (results.length === 0) errors.push('results');\n\nif (errors.length > 0) {\n  return {\n    valid: false,\n    errors: errors,\n    message: 'Missing required fields: ' + errors.join(', ')\n  };\n}\n\nreturn {\n  valid: true,\n  data: {\n    batch_id: body.batch_id || null,\n    correlation_id: body.correlation_id || null,\n    results: results,\n    metadata: md,\n    job_id: md.job_id || null,\n    project_id: md.project_id || null,\n    channel_id: md.callback_channel_id || null,\n    target_lang: md.target_lang || null,\n    commentary_map: md.commentary_map || {}\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "torah-batch-cb-0002",
      "name": "Validate Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [224, 304]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "check-valid",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.valid }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "torah-batch-cb-0003",
      "name": "Input Valid?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [448, 304]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// ============================================\n// SPLIT RESULTS — one n8n item per translation result\n// ============================================\n\nconst data = $input.first().json.data;\nconst map = data.commentary_map || {};\n\nreturn (data.results || []).map(r => ({ json: {\n  job_id: data.job_id,\n  project_id: data.project_id,\n  channel_id: data.channel_id,\n  commentary_id: r.custom_id,\n  segment_id: (map[r.custom_id] || {}).segment_id,\n  ok: r.ok === true,\n  translated_text: r.ok ? r.text : null,\n  error: r.ok ? null : r.error\n}}));"
      },
      "id": "torah-batch-cb-0004",
      "name": "Split Results",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [672, 208]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "check-ok",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.ok }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "torah-batch-cb-0005",
      "name": "Saved?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [896, 208]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.TORAH_API_URL }}/api/translations/save",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ segment_id: $json.segment_id, commentary_id: $json.commentary_id, translated_text: $json.translated_text }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "id": "torah-batch-cb-0006",
      "name": "Save Translation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1120, 112],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "tag-job-id",
              "name": "job_id",
              "value": "={{ $('Split Results').item.json.job_id }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "tag-project-id",
              "name": "project_id",
              "value": "={{ $('Split Results').item.json.project_id }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "tag-channel-id",
              "name": "channel_id",
              "value": "={{ $('Split Results').item.json.channel_id }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "tag-commentary-id",
              "name": "commentary_id",
              "value": "={{ $('Split Results').item.json.commentary_id }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "tag-segment-id",
              "name": "segment_id",
              "value": "={{ $('Split Results').item.json.segment_id }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "tag-ok",
              "name": "ok",
              "value": "={{ $('Split Results').item.json.ok }}",
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            {
              "id": "tag-save-ok",
              "name": "save_ok",
              "value": "={{ $json.error ? false : true }}",
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            {
              "id": "tag-save-error",
              "name": "save_error",
              "value": "={{ $json.error ? ($json.error.message || JSON.stringify($json.error)) : '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "torah-batch-cb-0007",
      "name": "Tag Save Result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [1344, 112]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "torah-batch-cb-0008",
      "name": "Collect",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.merge",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [1568, 208]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// ============================================\n// AGGREGATE RESULTS — one summary item for job update + Discord\n// ============================================\n\nconst items = $input.all().map(i => i.json);\n\nlet okCount = 0;\nlet failCount = 0;\nitems.forEach(it => {\n  const translationOk = it.ok === true;\n  const saveOk = it.save_ok !== false;\n  if (translationOk && saveOk) okCount++; else failCount++;\n});\n\nconst first = items[0] || {};\n\nreturn {\n  job_id: first.job_id || null,\n  project_id: first.project_id || null,\n  channel_id: first.channel_id || null,\n  total: items.length,\n  ok_count: okCount,\n  fail_count: failCount\n};"
      },
      "id": "torah-batch-cb-0009",
      "name": "Aggregate Results",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1792, 208]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "check-job-id",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.job_id }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "torah-batch-cb-0010",
      "name": "Job ID Present?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [2016, 208]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "url": "={{ $env.TORAH_API_URL }}/api/v2/jobs/{{ $json.job_id }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ status: 'completed', output: { ok_count: $json.ok_count, fail_count: $json.fail_count, total: $json.total } }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 10000
        }
      },
      "id": "torah-batch-cb-0011",
      "name": "Update Job",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [2240, 112],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// ============================================\n// PREPARE DISCORD NOTIFICATION (batch)\n// ============================================\n\nconst agg = $('Aggregate Results').first().json;\n\nconst message = `✅ Traduction terminée (${agg.ok_count} ok / ${agg.fail_count} erreurs)`;\n\nreturn {\n  channel_id: agg.channel_id,\n  job_id: agg.job_id,\n  ok_count: agg.ok_count,\n  fail_count: agg.fail_count,\n  message: message\n};"
      },
      "id": "torah-batch-cb-0012",
      "name": "Prepare Discord",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [2464, 208]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "check-channel",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.channel_id }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "torah-batch-cb-0013",
      "name": "Has Channel?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [2688, 208]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://discord.com/api/v10/channels/{{ $json.channel_id }}/messages",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            },
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bot {{ $env.DISCORD_TOKEN }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ content: $json.message }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 10000
        }
      },
      "id": "torah-batch-cb-0014",
      "name": "Send Discord Notification",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [2912, 112],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// ============================================\n// FORMAT SUCCESS RESPONSE\n// ============================================\n\nconst discordResult = $input.first().json;\nconst msgData = $('Prepare Discord').first().json;\n\nreturn {\n  success: true,\n  job_id: msgData.job_id,\n  ok_count: msgData.ok_count,\n  fail_count: msgData.fail_count,\n  notification_sent: discordResult.id ? true : false,\n  message: 'Callback processed successfully'\n};"
      },
      "id": "torah-batch-cb-0015",
      "name": "Format Success Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [3136, 112]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// ============================================\n// FORMAT NO CHANNEL RESPONSE\n// ============================================\n\nconst msgData = $input.first().json;\n\nreturn {\n  success: true,\n  job_id: msgData.job_id,\n  ok_count: msgData.ok_count,\n  fail_count: msgData.fail_count,\n  notification_sent: false,\n  message: 'Callback processed (no channel to notify)'\n};"
      },
      "id": "torah-batch-cb-0016",
      "name": "Format No Channel Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [2912, 304]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// ============================================\n// FORMAT VALIDATION ERROR\n// ============================================\n\nconst input = $input.first().json;\n\nreturn {\n  success: false,\n  error: {\n    code: 'VALIDATION_ERROR',\n    message: input.message || 'Invalid callback data',\n    http_status: 400\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "torah-batch-cb-0017",
      "name": "Format Error Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [672, 400]
    },
